5,1,1,talk,May,,Let's get this sorted. I want to know about the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log for this point.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'll look into supervised mornings on the next lane and the visit to the station block's bin house.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm on it! I'll check the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,I think the station block's meeting minutes and statements at the residents' meeting would be helpful for our harmony.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I shall investigate the truck arrival time from the crew leader and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
