24,2,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
25,2,1,talk,May,,"It turns out the current location is a real pain for the owner, and some of our frontages are way too narrow for a bin.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The next lane's supervision is a small time commitment, but the station block's bin house actually smells worse in summer.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"We're spending quite a bit on maintenance already, and a new shelter is expensive, though the ward helps a bit.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Midori,,"People are hesitant to police each other's bags, and the station block ended up fighting over repairs to their structure.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The truck arrives quite early, and the paperwork for a permanent build or moving the site is surprisingly tedious.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, how much are we talking about for a shelter? If it's too high, we can't do it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Servas, if the paperwork for moving the site is hard, maybe rotating it isn't as simple as it sounds.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"It's around two hundred thousand yen, minus the subsidy. Still, the yearly upkeep is a steady drain.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried that any system requiring us to ""supervise"" or ""police"" each other will just cause more arguments.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Servas,,Indeed. The early arrival of the truck also makes a strict window very difficult for those who sleep late.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,May,,"If we can't move it easily and can't afford a fancy box, what's left? We can't keep it at one gate.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, if the bin house is a smell trap and causes fights, we should definitely avoid a permanent enclosure.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I agree. Let's find something that doesn't break the bank or make us fight.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@May, if the frontages are uneven, rotating it might be unfair to the person with the narrowest path.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Servas,,We must consider the burden of time as well as money. Constant filing is a burden of its own.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
